-- 5. gate (README)
   G1 size matters at s 0: α*(15) − α*(100) = 2 − 1 = 1 -> PASS (need ≥ 1.0)
   G2 the formula works: selected M3 (size term: True); LOO regret 0.68 vs M1 1.49 (need ≥ 1 point better: False); test gap to the cell's best α -0.09% (need ≤ 2); Holm-significantly better than α 3 in 13 / 18 cells (need ≥ half); significantly worse in 0 -> FAIL
   G3 it transfers (held-out cells): m30_s0.75 vs α 3 -26.00 [CI hi -19.16], vs hindsight best α +0.30; m75_s0.75 vs α 3 -26.09 [CI hi -18.25], vs hindsight best α +1.22 -> PASS
   overall: see README: report the α curves as a guideline
